### Hae kaikki kortit
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cards

### Lisää uusi kortti
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Darth Vader, Commanding the 501st",
  "cardNumber": "010",
  "type": "Leader",
  "cost": 7,
  "power": 5,
  "hp": 8,
  "rarity": "Legendary",
  "imageUrl": "https://api.swu-db.com/cards/sor/010.png",
  "expansionSet": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

### Muokkaa korttia (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/cards/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Darth Vader, Commanding the 501st",
  "cardNumber": "010",
  "type": "Leader",
  "cost": 7,
  "power": 6, 
  "hp": 9,
  "rarity": "Legendary",
  "imageUrl": "https://api.swu-db.com/cards/sor/010.png",
  "expansionSet": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

### Poista kortti (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cards/1